      <activity id="eb17d234-74d3-5810-b09d-ed9fcdd7f6b4" activityNameId="e7d31bfb-b8eb-5dd4-8cb2-af672f07a129" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maize seed organic, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maize seed organic, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of maize seed (fresh weight), with a maximum water content of 12%;
UUID: a15c3d6a-8254-305b-9b1d-474359811007
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing (for integrated production) and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. No data on wastewater production were available.
Location: undefined
Technology: Refers to average seed processing
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: Consumption of maize seed in Switzerland is 1'963 t/year, 79% imported
Sampling: Data based on a literature, expert information and enquiry of seed processing plants. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a15c3d6a-8254-305b-9b1d-474359811007.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
